Subject: corecell HAL: talk to USB MCU firmware older than 1.0.0

Some USB corecell modules ship with STM32 firmware older than 1.0.0, whose
multiple-SPI order IDs are one higher (0x06/0x46 instead of 0x05/0x45). The
HAL records the MCU version when it opens the USB link and adjusts the IDs.
Changes the HAL patch station applies (deps/lgw1302).

